WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Hey, Laura. Thanks for coming in.

2
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.066
So your Friday reports

3
00:00:04.066 --> 00:00:06.933
have been a little late, which is fine.

4
00:00:06.966 --> 00:00:08.433
I mean, not fine.

5
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.000
You know what I mean, right?

6
00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:12.400
I mean, we've worked together forever.

7
00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:13.200
Right.

8
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.566
So I don't want to make this

9
00:00:14.566 --> 00:00:17.533
a whole boss thing, but I guess

10
00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:20.033
technically, I am your boss now.

11
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.700
Is that weird?

12
00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:26.833
It's getting there.

13
00:00:29.066 --> 00:00:30.266
Right.

14
00:00:30.466 --> 00:00:32.900
Okay, let's start over.
